  "details": "There is way too much rasist content being put up on public world video players. Almost on a daily basis this hatefull content is exposed to many kids shaping their belief systems at a young age.  A very effective way to reduce this would be to allowing only higher rank trust levels being allowed to use the video player. These players also often use crashing avatars so limiting avatar features that use large amounts of particles, to higher ranks would also be handy. Also give us an option to reduce partlcle limit to values lower than 200.",
